          {
            "type": "polymorph",
            "category": "control",
            "wording": "polymorphs",
            "evidence": "Her and nearby allies' immobilizing effects and polymorphs against enemy champions will also apply a stack of Plasma.",
            "conditional": false
          }
        ],
        "values": []
      },
      {
        "label": "Innate - Caustic Wounds",
        "text": "Innate - Caustic Wounds: Plasma stacks applied by Kai'Sa's basic attacks or Void Seeker deal 4 – 30 (based on level) (+ 12% AP) additional magic damage plus 1 – 8 (based on level) (+ 3% AP) additional magic damage per Plasma stack before application, up to a total of 8 – 62 (based on level) (+ 24% AP) additional magic damage at 4 Plasma stacks before application. The fifth stack against a target consumes them all to deal additional magic damage equal to 15% (+ 6% per 100 AP) of the target's missing health, capped at 400 against monsters.",
